$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM THF was degassed by freeze-thawing. To a stirred solution of aldehyde S10
(130 mg, 0.310 mmol) in THF (3.1 mL) were added CHI3 (245 mg, 0.621 mmol)
and CrCl2 (382 mg, 3.10 mmol) at room temperature in a glove box. The
mixture was stirred at room temperature for 3 h in a glove box, poured
into ice (15.0 g), and extracted with Et2O (10 mL × 3). The combined
extracts were dried (MgSO4) and concentrated in vacuo. The crude product
was purified by column chromatography on silica gel (5.0 g, hexane-EtOAc
200:1→50:1). Compound: C21-C28 segment 7, Yield: 157 mg, 93% as a
colorless oil. [α]28D -32.3 (c 1.54, CHCl3); IR (CHCl3) 3006, 2930, 1603,
1471, 1463, 1255, 1095, 837, 732 cm-1; 1H NMR (600 MHz, CDCl3) δ 6.57
(dd, J= 14.5, 7.4 Hz, 1H), 6.03 (dd, J= 14.5, 1.2 Hz, 1H), 3.95 (tt, J=
7.1, 4.7 Hz, 1H), 3.67 (t, J= 7.1 Hz, 2H), 3.32 (s, 3H), 3.16 (dt, J=
8.3, 4.2 Hz, 1H), 2.49 (m, 1H), 1.71 (ddt, J= 13.6, 7.1, 4.7 Hz, 1H),
1.62 (dq, J= 13.6, 7.1 Hz, 1H), 1.59 (ddd, J= 14.2, 8.3, 4.7 Hz, 1H),
1.52 (ddd, J= 14.2, 7.1, 4.2 Hz, 1H), 0.99 (d, J= 7.0 Hz, 3H), 0.89 (s,
9H), 0.89 (s, 9H), 0.06 (s, 3H), 0.05 (s, 3H), 0.05 (s, 6H); 13C NMR (150
MHz, CDCl3) δ 148.5, 80.9, 75.0, 66.6, 59.8, 57.4, 42.7, 39.9, 38.7, 25.9
(3C), 25.9 (3C), 18.2, 18.0, 14.2, -4.3, -4.6, -5.3 (2C); HRMS (ESI) m/z
565.2004, calcd for C22H47INaO3Si2 [M+Na]+ 565.2006.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM stereoselective, glovebox used, Takai olefination
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Design, synthesis, and biological evaluations of aplyronine A-mycalolide
B hybrid compound
