$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM (2S,3S,10S,Z)-1-(4-methoxybenzyloxy)-2-methyl-7-(trimethylsilylmethylene)tridec-11-yne-3,10-diol(24):
According to the literature11, Zn(OTf)2 (617.4 mg, 1.70 mmol) and
(-)-N-methylephedrine (335.6 mg, 1.87 mmol) were added to a flame-dried
round bottom flask and purged with argon 3 times. Toluene (2.3 mL) and
distilled Et3N (0.25 ml, 1.79 mmol) were added, and the mixture was
stirred vigorously for 2 h at rt. Then, excess propyne (~ 0.2 mL) in
toluene (0.5 mL) was added to the mixture at -78 °C via cannula. The
reaction mixture was slowly warmed to rt and stirred for 10 min. Aldehyde
23a (345.8 mg, 0.850 mmol) in toluene (1.3 mL + 0.2 mL rinse) was added
to the mixture over 5 h by syringe pump and further stirred for another
19 h. The reaction was diluted with sat. NH4Cl aq., extracted with EtOAc,
dried over Na2SO4, filtered, and concentrated in vacuo. Column
chromatography (hexane/EtOAc = 2/1) provided 24 . Yield 341.1mg, 90%,
colorless oil. 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3) δ : 0.10(9 H, s), 0.90 (3 H, d, J=
7.1Hz),1.35-1.45 (2 H, m),1.60-1.67 (2 H, m), 1.72-1.79 (2 H,
m),1.84-1.91(4H, m),2.07-2.11(2 H, m),2.27 (2H, t, J= 8.6Hz), 2.60 (1 H,
d, J= 4.7Hz),3.48-3.51(2 H, m),3.73-3.76 (1 H, m), 3.81(3 H,
s),4.31-4.36(1 H, m), 4.39 (1 H, A in ABq, J= 11.7Hz), 4.41 (1 H, B in
ABq, J= 11.7Hz), 5.23(1 H, s), 6.87-6.89 (2 H, m),7.23-7.25 (2 H, m); 13C
NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3) δ : 0.4, 3.6, 11.0, 24.8, 31.6, 33.6, 37.5, 37.9,
38.9, 55.4, 62.7, 73.2, 74.1, 74.4, 80.5, 81.4, 113.9, 124.2, 129.4,
130.2, 158.6, 159.3; IR (neat): 3423, 2949, 2321, 1611, 1514, 1246 cm-1;
[α]D28= -11.8(c= 0.60, CHCl3); HRMS (ESI): Calcd forC26H42NaO4Si [M + Na]
469.2750 found 469.2745.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM stereoselective (dr = >20:1), syringe pump addition of aldehyde/toluene
stage 3, Carreira asymmetric acetylide addition
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
