$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM (S)-2-((2S,4R,5R)-4-Acetoxy-5-((R)-5-((2R,6R)-6-((E)-5-((tert-butyldiphenylsilyl)oxy)pent-1-en-1-yl)-2-methoxy-3,6-dihydro-2H-pyran-2-yl)-2-methyl-3-oxopent-4-yn-1-yl)tetrahydrofuran-2-yl)-2-((triisopropylsilyl)oxy)ethyl
pivalate (26a). To a mixture of CrCl2 (42 mg, 0.34 mmol) and NiCl2 (0.2
mg, 1.5 μmol) at rt was added a solution of aldehyde 7 (38 mg, 76 μmol)
and iodide 6 (35 mg, 60 μmol) in THF (3 mL) via cannula. The suspension
was stirred at rt for 12 h before diethyl ether (10 mL) and an aqueous
solution of 1 M serine saturated with NaHCO3 (10 mL) were added. The
resulting mixture was stirred at rt for 1 h. The organic phase was
separated and the aqueous layer was extracted with diethyl ether (3 x 5
mL). The combined organic phase was washed with brine, dried over Na2SO4,
filtered and concentrated. The residue was purified by flash
chromatography (hexanes-ethyl acetate, 5:1, v/v) to give alcohol 26.
Colorless oil (45 mg, 47 μmol, 78%).
