$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM (9H-Fluoren-9-yl)methyl (2E,4E)-5-Iodopenta-2,4-dienylcarbamate (4). To a
suspension of CrCl2 (4.1 g, 33.4 mmol) in THF (51 mL) at 0 °C were added
CHI3 (5.06 g, 5.28 mmol) and 19 (1.58 g, 5.14 mmol). After stirring at rt
for 24 h, the reaction was quenched with saturated Na2S2O3 (30 mL), and
the mixture was extracted with AcOEt. The extract was washed with brine,
dried, concentrated, and chromatographed (SiO2 150 g, hexane:AcOEt = 15:1
to 10:1 to 4:1 to 1:1) to give 4 (1.47g, 66%), a yellow solid, as a 8:1
E/Z-mixture which was recrystallized from AcOEt to give geometrically
pure 4 (0.98 g, 44%) as colorless crystals. 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3) δ
7.77 (d, J = 7.5 Hz, 2H), 7.58 (d, J = 7.3 H, 2H), 7.40 (t, J = 7.5 Hz,
2H), 7.31 (t, J = 7.3 Hz, 2H), 7.00 (dd, J = 10.7, 14.0 Hz, 1H), 6.32 (d,
J = 14.0 Hz, 1H), 6.11-6.04 (m, 1H), 5.74-5.66 (m, 1H), 4.82 (brs, 1H),
4.43 (d, J = 6.6 Hz, 2H), 4.22 (t, J = 6.6 Hz, 1H), 3.82 (brs, 2H); 13C
NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3) δ 156.0, 144.1, 143.8 (2), 141.2 (2), 131.4, 130.3,
127.6 (2), 127.0 (2), 124.9 (2), 120.2 (2), 79.6, 66.7, 47.3, 42.3; FTIR
(neat) 3317, 3053, 1687, 1531, 1442, 1263, 1146, 1263, 1146, 980, 733
cm-1; HRMS (EI) calcd for C20H18NIO2 (M+) 431.0382, found: 431.0381.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM stereoselective (E/Z=8:1), Takai iodoalkenylation, 44% yield of pure
E-isomer isolated
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Total synthesis of oxazolomycin A
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
